### Log in as admin → captures accessToken
POST https://mockhub.kousenit.com/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken);
    client.log("Token captured, expires in " + response.body.expiresIn);
%}

### Reset demo buyer (main demo account)
POST https://mockhub.kousenit.com/api/v1/admin/demo/reset
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userEmail": "buyer@mockhub.com" }

### Reset alice (confused-deputy demo)
POST https://mockhub.kousenit.com/api/v1/admin/demo/reset
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userEmail": "alice@mockhub.com" }

### Reset bob (receives the confused-deputy order)
POST https://mockhub.kousenit.com/api/v1/admin/demo/reset
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userEmail": "bob@mockhub.com" }